/E (This quartz deposit was formed 380 to 400 million years ago when the African and North American continents collided pushing rocks miles below the surface where two key things happened. The rocks were melted and baked for about 100 million years where they slowly slowly cooled allowing for huge crystals to be created as well as there was no water contamination. Water brings with it contamination affecting the purity of the quartz so without it the quartz were able to develop almost impurity free.)
